   520			// `ownsAgent` reads `agent_users`, but legacy ownership can survive only
   521			// in agent metadata (`agents.owner_*`) that was never reconciled into the
   522			// mapping. Mirror the ownership resolver's metadata fallback so those
   523			// owners keep the legacy bound-channel path. `getMetadata` is ALS-scoped to
   524			// the ambient org, so a match proves ambient-org ownership: a per-org
   525			// SYSTEM agent (the Builder) has no per-user owner in a shared org (owner
   526			// column is NULL), so system-agent admins still fall through to the
   527			// enforced ACL below, unchanged. Reconcile into `agent_users` so the next
   528			// read hits the fast path.
   529			const metadata = await deps.agentConfigStore?.getMetadata(agentId);
